---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import OemPageHero from '../components/sunday/OemPageHero.astro';
import OemFeature from '../components/sunday/OemFeature.astro';
import OemPhotoCollection from '../components/sunday/OemPhotoCollection.astro';
import OemReading from '../components/sunday/OemReading.astro';
import FactoryExteriorPhoto from '../components/sunday/FactoryExteriorPhoto.astro';
import VideoFigure from '../components/VideoFigure.astro';
import InquiryCallout from '../components/InquiryCallout.astro';
import { oemWorkshopImages, oemWorkshopPhoto } from '../data/oemWorkshopPhotography';
import '../styles/oem-editorial.css';
import { PUBLIC_COMPANY_RELATIONSHIP } from '../data/site';
const documentRequest='/contact/?request=documents#inquiry-form';
const inspectionImage = '/images/inspection-two-lead-20261105/inspection-cbb65';
const records=[
 {name:'Product samples',request:'Sample reference, full model number and the sample submitted for approval.'},
 {name:'Datasheets and drawings',request:'Current model datasheet and dimensioned drawing, with revision or date.'},
 {name:'Test and inspection reports',request:'Model and sample or batch reference; test date, method and conditions; instrument ID; acceptance limits, measured results and reviewer signature.'},
 {name:'Certificates',request:'Certificate holder, issuer, certificate number, covered models and ratings, standard edition, destination requirements and validity.'},
 {name:'Marking and packing',request:'Approved label artwork and packing specification, linked to the order reference.'}
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Motor Capacitor Manufacturing & Quality" description="Motor capacitor production equipment and component handling, with a checklist for model drawings, capacitance tests and inspection records.">
  <article class="oem-suite oe-factory">
    <OemPageHero titleId="factory-title" title="Manufacturing and quality" description={PUBLIC_COMPANY_RELATIONSHIP} current="Manufacturing">
      <a class="button" href={documentRequest}>Request model documents</a>
      <FactoryExteriorPhoto slot="media" eager sizes="(max-width: 800px) calc(100vw - 48px), (min-width: 1360px) 700px, 54vw" />
    </OemPageHero>
    <div id="factory-process-title"><span id="factory-footage-title"></span>
      <OemFeature id="material-process" title="Film processing">
        <div slot="media"><VideoFigure src="/videos/film-roll-equipment.mp4" poster="/images/real/film-rolls.jpg" label="Film roll moving through workshop processing equipment" displayRatio="3/2" cover={oemWorkshopImages['07-reel-equipment']} /></div>
        <p>CBB60, CBB61 and CBB65 use film construction. The footage shows a film roll passing through the processing equipment.</p>
        <p>CD60 uses aluminium electrolytic construction for starting duty. Its circuit disconnects it after startup.</p>
        <a class="oe-link" href="/resources/start-vs-run-capacitors/">Start and run capacitor construction</a>
      </OemFeature>
      <OemFeature id="winding-equipment" title="Equipment and component handling" reverse tone="steel">
        <div slot="media"><VideoFigure src="/videos/winding-equipment.mp4" poster="/images/real/winding-equipment.jpg" label="Enclosed production equipment and its control panel in operation" displayRatio="3/2" cover={oemWorkshopImages['02-film-machine']} /></div>
        <p>Reels and tooling sit alongside the operator workstations. The assembly views show metal can bodies and terminal ends before final assembly.</p>
        <p>Use a dimensioned drawing to check that the capacitor body, mounting and connections fit the available space in your equipment.</p>
        <a class="oe-link" href="/factory/process-gallery/#film-equipment">Equipment and tooling gallery</a>
      </OemFeature>
      <OemFeature id="electrical-testing" title="Reading an inspection report">
        <figure slot="media" data-image-kind="ai-refined-illustration">
          <img
            src={`${inspectionImage}-1536.webp`}
            srcset={`${inspectionImage}-480.webp 480w, ${inspectionImage}-768.webp 768w, ${inspectionImage}-1536.webp 1536w`}
            sizes="(max-width: 800px) calc(100vw - 48px), 52vw"
            width="1536"
            height="1024"
            alt="Red and black test leads clipped to separate terminal groups on a CBB65 single-run capacitor."
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </figure>
        <p>A capacitance inspection report needs the model, sample or batch reference, nominal value, tolerance and measured result, together with the measurement conditions.</p>
        <p>Insulation-resistance and voltage-withstand results need their own test conditions and acceptance limits. The report should also identify the test date.</p>
        <a class="oe-link" href="/resources/oem-capacitor-sample-approval/#review-the-test-record">Review a sample test record</a>
      </OemFeature>
    </div>
    <OemPhotoCollection id="workshop-photo-sequence" title="Can bodies and assembly work" intro="Metal cans at an assembly station, with a closer view of the terminal ends arranged in a tray." photos={[oemWorkshopPhoto('09-assembly-machine','Assembly station'),oemWorkshopPhoto('13-terminal-array','Terminal groups in the tray')]} moreHref="/factory/process-gallery/" moreLabel="Explore the complete process gallery" />
    <section class="oe-section" id="model-records"><div class="oe-shell">
      <header class="oe-section-heading"><h2 id="factory-records-title">Documents for your selected model</h2><p>Include the full model number, ratings and destination in your document request. Match the drawing revision and sample reference across the quotation, approval and inspection records.</p></header>
      <table class="procurement-table oe-table procurement-model-records"><caption class="visually-hidden">Documents and details for the selected motor capacitor model</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Record</th><th scope="col">Details to request</th></tr></thead><tbody>{records.map(record=><tr><th scope="row">{record.name}</th><td><span class="procurement-mobile-label" aria-hidden="true">Details to request</span>{record.request}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table>
      <div class="oe-note" id="inspection-records"><h3>Sample approval and batch inspection</h3><p>A sample report covers the part submitted for approval; a batch report covers the production lot inspected. State which report you need in the order requirements.</p><a class="oe-link" href="/downloads/model-document-request.txt" download="hanxing-model-document-request.txt">Download document request checklist</a></div>
    </div></section>
    <div id="packing-warehouse"><OemReading links={[{title:'Packing and dispatch',description:'Unit protection, carton quantities and carrier handover.',href:'/factory/packing-and-dispatch/'},{title:'Approve an OEM sample',description:'A practical record for drawing, sample and label approval.',href:'/resources/oem-capacitor-sample-approval/'},{title:'Company information',description:'Business details to keep with the quotation and supplier records.',href:'/about/#supplier-records'}]} /></div>
    <InquiryCallout showVisual={false} href={documentRequest} defaultSeries="unknown" heading="Request model documents" description="Include the full model reference, destination and records you need." buttonLabel="Request documents"><a class="card-link" href="/buying-guide/#rfq-template">Quotation checklist</a></InquiryCallout>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
